  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5705.05 Federal Agency Request",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-09-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5705.05 Federal Agency Request. Each request for criminal history record checks utilizing the national indices made under federal authority shall be submitted through the FBI or, if the state criminal history record repository consents to process fingerprint submissions, through the criminal history record repository in the state in which the request originated.\n\nSource. #8173, eff 9-21-04, EXPIRED: 9-21-12\n\nNew. #10208, eff 10-22-12; ss by #12132, eff 3-17-17; renumbered by #12606 (formerly Saf-C 5704.05)",
